transliteration:
Logassa ujjoagare, dhamma titthayare jiṇe;
Arihaṃte kittaiassaṃ, cauvīsampi kevalī.
Usabham ajiaṃ ca vande, saṃbhavam abhiṇaṃdaṇaṃ ca Sumaiṃ ca;
Pauma-ppahaṃ Supāsaṃ, jiṇaṃ ca Caṃdappahaṃ vande.
Suvihiṃ ca Pupphadaṃtaṃ, Sīala-Sijjaṃsaṃ Vāsupujjaṃ ca;
Vimala-Maṇataṃ ca jiṇaṃ, Dhamma-Saṭiṃ ca vandāmi.
Kuhuṃthu Araṃ ca Malliṃ, vande Muṇisuvvayaṃ Nami-jiṇaṃ ca;
Vandāmi Riṭṭa-Nemiṃ, Pāsaṃ taha Vaddhamāṇaṃ ca.
Evaṃ mae abhithuā, vihūya raya-malā pahīṇa-jara-maraṇā;
Cauvīsampi jiṇavarā, titthayarā me pasīyaṃtu.
Kittiya-vadiya-mahiyā, je e logassa uttamā Siddhā;
Ārugga-bohilaabhaṃ, samāhi-varam-uttamaṃ dītu.
Caṃdesu nimmalaya-rā, aiccesu ahiaṃ payāsayarā;
Sāgaravara-gambhīrā, Siddhā siddhiṃ mama disaṃtu.
